ere  for a while but I will be coming to you  over the next couple of months from a  few different conferences and different  locations which I will be announcing as  we get closer to them we are also almost  ready to do a round of website updates  there are going to be some updates to  the members section to make it more  functional based on popular demand one  really often requested feature is an  easier way to gift  descriptions right now to gift a  subscription on our website you  basically go in and you just act as if  you're signing up as someone else you  put in the recipients name and the  recipients email but your payment  information and it's kind of clunky so  we're exploring either some kind of  coupon code like you can buy a coupon  code if you want to buy someone a $60  membership you buy a coupon code you  give it to them then they can apply it  to their membership we're thinking of a  couple of other ways as well if you have  specific website suggestions for david  pakman.com that you want implemented  this is a very very good time to let me  know  and then lastly I've gotten a lot of  enquiries about what's happening next  week with the third Democratic  presidential debate which is on ABC and  I believe it's ABC Univision as many of  you know I started live commentary of  the second debate which was on CNN last  month and within two minutes CNN shut me  down  gave us a copyright strike on YouTube it  was a fiasco their vice president of  corporate communications or something  publicly shamed me for wanting to do the  commentary and we ended up over on  twitch at twitch.tv slash David Pakman  and since I've been streaming a lot on  Twitch so here's my plan  I am formally working through the  process to get whitelisted by ABC to do  live commentary of the debate it could  be a 1% chance that that works or a 90%  chance  I don't know I'm working with my YouTube  rep to try to get ABC to say David it's  okay for you to live stream on YouTube  and do li